<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage back above 10 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage back above 10 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 10.167 billion rand on Thursday from 9.171 billion rand on Wednesday, the Reserve Bank said on Friday.</p>
</text>
